%%% note
Salesforce コネクタの OAuth の認可コード (config-with-oauth-connection): 認可の前の操作、認可の口 (/authorize) の
リダイレクト先、認可 (sfauth: sf CLI の d30 のセッションで Salesforce の認可を通してコールバックまで)、認可の後の
操作、unauthorize、その後の操作。接続アプリ "mulay oracle" にコールバック http://localhost:18172/callback を登録して
ある (PKCE は求めない)。組織のホスト名、client_id、state は伏せる。
認証情報は src/main/resources/sf-secret.yaml (リポジトリに入れない。sf.clientId、sf.clientSecret、sf.tokenUrl、
sf.authorizeUrl)。
%%% requires src/main/resources/sf-secret.yaml
%%% port 18172
%%% mask
https://([^/\s]+)/services/
[?&](?:client_id|state)=([^&\s]+)
%%% request GET /org
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "type": "SALESFORCE:CONNECTIVITY",
  "description": "OAuth authorization dance not yet performed for resourceOwnerId null"
}
%%% request GET /authorize headers=location
%%% response 302
location: https://***/services/oauth2/authorize?response_type=code&client_id=***&scope=api+refresh_token&redirect_uri=http%3A%2F%2Flocalhost%3A18172%2Fcallback


%%% sfauth d30 /authorize
%%% response 400

error=invalid_request&error_description=missing%20required%20code%20challenge
%%% request GET /org
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "type": "SALESFORCE:CONNECTIVITY",
  "description": "OAuth authorization dance not yet performed for resourceOwnerId null"
}
%%% request POST /unauthorize
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "type": "Binary",
  "mime": "*/*"
}
%%% request GET /org
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "type": "SALESFORCE:CONNECTIVITY",
  "description": "OAuth authorization dance not yet performed for resourceOwnerId null"
}
